3. Ideas only (no code used)
----------------------------

ufal/whisper_streaming, collabora/WhisperLive, QuentinFuxa/WhisperLiveKit,
KoljaB/RealtimeSTT (real-time Whisper pipelines; v2.2.1: confirming a full stop
over a few polls before a sentence counts as finished) and yuxino/Mimi
(per-process capture for captions). From GPL projects only ideas, written from
scratch (v2.2.1): requests-per-minute pacing per key (HIllya51/LunaTranslator)
and lyrics search hits scored by title and artist similarity
(jayfunc/BetterLyrics).
